# Everything under out/ and store/ is machine-specific evidence produced by a
# run on one person's box: absolute paths, profile names, scheduled task names,
# and command lines that can carry credentials in plaintext (a rasdial task
# stores the dial-up password as an argument). None of it belongs in a commit,
# and report.html is redacted but facts-*.json is not.
out/
store/

# Recurrence timelines are built from the browser's own .bak_* siblings, which
# live inside the profile directory, not here - listed so nobody assumes the
# tool stages backups next to the code.
*.bak_*

*.log
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
